{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/releasenotes"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Senior iOS Engineer with 12+ years of experience shipping apps that people actually use —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from real-time messaging platforms to fintech, transit, and enterprise tooling."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"ReleaseNotes","symbolKind":"module","color":{"standardColorIdentifier":"blue"},"roleHeading":"Welcome to","modules":[{"name":"Haydar Karkin"}],"title":"Haydar Karkin","role":"collection"},"topicSections":[{"abstract":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Career history — what shipped, when, and with what impact."}]}],"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ReleaseNotes\/documentation\/ReleaseNotes\/Experience"],"anchor":"Changelog","title":"Changelog"},{"abstract":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tools and technologies I work with."}]}],"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ReleaseNotes\/documentation\/ReleaseNotes\/Skills"],"anchor":"Dependencies","title":"Dependencies"},{"abstract":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Education and formal training."}]}],"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ReleaseNotes\/documentation\/ReleaseNotes\/Education"],"anchor":"Build-History","title":"Build History"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ReleaseNotes\/documentation\/ReleaseNotes\/ReleaseNotes"],"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ReleaseNotes\/documentation\/ReleaseNotes","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"I’ve spent over a decade at the intersection of clean architecture and product delivery,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"working across Turkey, and now Germany. I’ve contributed to apps with millions of active"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"users — including "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"BIP","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (3.5M monthly actives), "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Finansbank","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (2M+ users), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"ioki","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"’s white-label transit platform powering 70+ branded applications across Europe."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"My engineering philosophy is simple: code should be easy to delete, easy to test,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and hard to misuse. I care deeply about the boundaries between layers, the contracts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"between modules, and the kind of pull request that teaches rather than just passes review."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Beyond writing Swift, I’ve led teams, introduced testing cultures from scratch, built"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"CI\/CD pipelines, and pushed for practices that make codebases healthier over time —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not just on the day they’re written."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This site is my development hub: a living CV, a place to think out loud about iOS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"development, and a record of what I’ve built and learned along the way."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Currently","anchor":"Currently","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"🚀 Senior iOS Developer at ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"ioki","type":"text"}]},{"text":", Frankfurt — building the future of demand-responsive transit","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"